[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17880.55, "timestamp": "04:58:00", "text": "在Twitch上关注我。谢谢。谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17882.948, "timestamp": "04:58:02", "text": "谢谢。希望你一切都好。现在，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17885.43, "timestamp": "04:58:05", "text": "所以今天我们要玩的是《Valerant》。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17887.99, "timestamp": "04:58:07", "text": "今天，每个人都在玩一款新的游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17892.23, "timestamp": "04:58:12", "text": "Valerant 最近。新特工退出了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17896.27, "timestamp": "04:58:16", "text": "我对此感到很兴奋。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17899.83, "timestamp": "04:58:19", "text": "是的。是的。呃，这也是第一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17901.31, "timestamp": "04:58:21", "text": "流"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17905.27, "timestamp": "04:58:25", "text": "月。嗯，是在十一月份。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17908.23, "timestamp": "04:58:28", "text": "所以，让我们一起尽力而为吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17910.31, "timestamp": "04:58:30", "text": "又过了一个月。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17911.628, "timestamp": "04:58:31", "text": "一起"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17915.83, "timestamp": "04:58:35", "text": "我们？那么，今天的直播内容将是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17919.99, "timestamp": "04:58:39", "text": "在瓦莱兰多教堂里坐着。呃，不是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17921.31, "timestamp": "04:58:41", "text": "真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17923.75, "timestamp": "04:58:43", "text": "参与性含义我不知道我是否"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17924.83, "timestamp": "04:58:44", "text": "会做到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17926.84, "timestamp": "04:58:46", "text": "参与式但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17939.19, "timestamp": "04:58:59", "text": "嗯，是的，所以我觉得没问题，我们可以放手。"}]